  PATTERN (latest session)
  1) Liquidity sweep: a low below the last swing low (last 30 sessions), reclaimed within 3 bars
     - or a CHoCH higher swing low (no sweep)
  2) Bullish MSS: a close above the last swing high within 15 sessions
  3) The sweep low held since
  4) Today: first pullback into the retest zone (+/- 0.25 ATR) or the FVG
  5) Today's close at or above the bottom of that zone
